'''Primordial Cat''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 8.1 Update|Version 8.1]] and can be unlocked when beating the stage [[Charybdis' Mouth (Merciless)|Typhoon Nemo]]. [[True Form]] was implemented in [[Version 10.3 Update|Version 10.3]] and has a longer attack animation, but replaces [[Resistant]] with [[Insanely Tough]].

