}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Modern Cat''' at level 10.

Evolves into '''Future Cat''' when obtained from [[Typhoon Nihil]] (guaranteed to drop) and is level 20 or above.

==Strategy/Usage==
Primordial Cat serves as a durable meatshield against Metal and Relic enemies with her high effective health and singular knockback. However, her recharge time is too long for her to be used as your main source of defense in most scenarios. She also doesn't perform too well in mixed stages, and can falter against [[Super Metal Hippoe]]/[[M. Ost]] due to their knockback and slow abilities.

Especially useful against [[Relic Bun-Bun]], who takes '''5 hits''' at 100% strength magnification to destroy a level 40 Modern Cat.

==='''True Form'''===
Due to the change from Resistant to Insanely Tough, Future Cat's health is improved by '''50%''' vs. Metal and Relic enemies, greatly enhancing her already excellent specialist performance. Once [[Maize Cat (Rare Cat)|Cone Cat]] is unlocked however, her Relic-tanking niche will become outclassed, though she can still see use as an accessible anti-Metal meatshield in addition to being able to be used in mixed stages such as [[Personal Issue]].

