==Trivia==
*Primordial Cat's ears grow longer and pointier as she evolves.
*Modern Cat's Japanese description refers to a ''[[wikipedia:Zabuton|zabuton]]'', a common type of Japanese cushion for sitting.
*Future Cat's jumpsuit is very similar to that of [[wikia:doraemon:Sewashi Nobi|Sewashi Nobi]], the time-traveling great-great-grandson of Nobita in ''Doraemon''.
*Future Cat's Japanese description directly mentions [[wikipedia:Bon Curry|Bon Curry]], a Japanese curry brand and the world's first commercial retort food product.
*Future Cat is currently the only non-[[:Category:Gacha Cats|Gacha]] Cat to have the [[Insanely Tough]] ability.
*Future Cat and [[Brainwashed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Brainwashed Eraser Cat]] are also the only non-[[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber]]/[[:Category:Legend Rare Cats|Legend Rare]] units to have the [[Insanely Tough]] ability.

